sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Apply Executor
  participant J as Job Store / Journal
  participant F as Filesystem
  participant T as Transformer
  participant V as Independent Verifier
  A->>F: Revalidate source identity/fingerprint
  A->>F: Create and verify backup
  A->>F: Create same-directory stage
  A->>T: Transform pixels + metadata into stage
  T-->>A: Staged artifact
  A->>F: Flush and close stage
  A->>V: Reopen and verify stage
  V-->>A: VerifiedArtifact
  A->>J: Commit IntentDurable
  J-->>A: Durable acknowledgement
  A->>F: ReplaceFileW / qualified atomic replace
  F-->>A: Replacement result
  A->>V: Verify final path
  V-->>A: Final verification
  A->>J: Commit completion checkpoint
